{"parse": {"title": "11TH-12", "pageid": 110483, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-11\" title=\"11TH-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-13\" title=\"11TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A0.B4.E7.A2.8E.E7.9A.84.E5.B0.96.E6.8B.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"破碎的尖拱\">破碎的尖拱</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 破碎的尖拱</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Fractured Sanctuary</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>传<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>石<span class=\"color-value\"></span>像<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>获<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>生<span class=\"color-value\"></span>命<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>装甲车？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>是。驾驶员是重塑之手的人，他们从军队里窃取了装备和资源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯另一头沉吟片刻，接着，属于“鹰派”党魁的声音从听筒中传出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>——刻雷乌斯，你有什么猜想？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，各派委员们正身处一室，共同听取前线的汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刻雷乌斯无声地发出轻笑，语调却仍然保持着严肃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>重塑之手也许组建了一支属于自己的军队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我持相同看法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我们要为这种情况早做打算。芝诺主力目前仍在东边，如果西线有变，他们短时间内无法增员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>基金会应当在西线招募一支属于自己的军队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>这不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>稳重的声音打断了过于夸张的猜想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>——扩充军队会向外投射紧张情绪，不符合我们的和平政策。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>而且，重塑之手只接受纯血神秘学家，他们不可能真正拥有一支足以形成战斗力的军队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>神秘学家缺乏纪律和组织必备的理智，如果没有人类领导，他们注定无法成为一支真正的军队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>你忽视了阿尔卡纳，佩德拉，你不知道祂会给信徒带来怎样的影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>基金会需要一支新的军队，尽早组织力量对重塑之手发动袭击。这样一来，也许我们还有先发制人的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-508110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>委员会绝不会同意如此不顾后果的策略——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-527421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>你根本看不清形势，佩德拉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯器已经无法清晰地捕捉到两派领袖的争吵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刻雷乌斯在另一头秉持着一贯顺从的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等待未久，调停人接管了通讯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-506821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-506821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-506821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我们不排除爆发大规模冲突的可能，但是，在没有绝对可信的证据之前，委员会仍将维持原本的策略。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>如果更坏的情况发生了呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-506821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-506821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-506821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>——整个时代都将化为战场。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>喔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术的余辉逐渐消散，一方宁静的避难所出现在林间空地中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教堂的穹顶虽然已经倒塌，但雕饰繁复的主体外墙仍然屹立不倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这座教堂……是本来就建造在这里的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嗯。石像鬼的神秘术在这片废墟上能发挥很好的效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>在“加尔都西”神秘术的保护下，教堂和石像鬼都不会被过路的人关注。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-560201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-560201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-560201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼修士：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位身穿修士长袍的石像鬼在草地上赤足行走，意识到访客的到来后，他从书本中抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你好，我是基金会的调查员玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>修士轻轻点头，笑容柔和而友善。他伸出一根手指，压在嘴唇上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这是……某种缄默修行吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“喀喀——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尚未得到回答，骑士又被另一侧岩石碎裂的铿锵声所吸引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇破损的窄窗下，一座女性雕塑突然活动起来，石质的表面逐渐化为柔软的皮肤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位满面愁容的妇人出现在玛尔纱眼前，她以夸张的步态向玛丽安娜走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>玛丽，我的好侄女，你终于回来了！看看你都消瘦成什么样子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她二话不说，就将玛丽安娜死死搂在怀里，又在她的面颊上留下一个深刻的吻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜已经习惯了这份沉重的亲族之爱，面不改色地接受了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>这是你的朋友吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人转而看向玛尔纱，眼角上更是聚了更多悲伤，几乎要流下泪来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>可怜……可怜的孩子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她以无可抗拒的力量把骑士拉到自己身边，照例给了她一个令人窒息的拥抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-526514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-526514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-526514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>唔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一秒。两秒。三秒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——她终于挣脱热情的待客之道。玛尔纱猛吸一口新鲜空气，青草的芬芳浸透了她的肺腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——呼……嗬……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>你们一定还有事，可我从来都帮不上忙呢……玛丽总是说我老啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>哎呀，我居然连一杯茶水都没有准备，这像什么话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她急匆匆地走开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……她是我姨妈，一年前自顾自地跑到这种危险的地方来，说这个家里的人都不能离开她的照顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>刚才和你打招呼的修士，在去年受伤之后就和他的兄弟一起到这里避难，却不知为何发誓保持静默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不解地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>留在这里的同族不算多。我还有一些家人分散在其他地方，也许只有在战争结束之后才有机会重聚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……你可以在这等着，玛德琳姨妈会给你端来茶水。我去拿你需要的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>好，我就在这儿等着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>等等……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然想起来，自己身旁的雕塑也许都是活生生的石像鬼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识到这一点后，不自在的感觉像蚂蚁一样爬上她的身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……你们好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在原地转了一圈，目光停留在一尊掩面哭泣的少女雕塑身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女悲惨而哀恸的姿态与其他的雕塑截然不同，很长一段时间内，玛尔纱的注意力都被她吸引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-526020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-526020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-526020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>为什么玛丽安娜会把你带进来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后传来一声几乎有些无礼的提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位清瘦高挑的修士出现在露天教堂的庭院中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你不是我们中的一员，却把战争带到这一片静修之地。基金会又想达成怎样的目的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的声音如同卵石在沙地上摩挲，话语中的指责意味清晰可闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我不会带来争斗，我只是想帮助你们结束这场战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>战争不需要我们，也不需要你来结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你说……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人先是沉默着，似乎在犹豫是否要开口解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后，他的五官绷成一幅过度揉捏的肖像画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这场大战是一次天罚，抛弃信仰的人必然要经受苦难方可获得拯救——战争只会在文明彻底灭亡之日终结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>难道……你希望看到人类和神秘学家走向灭亡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你在曲解我的观念，我又何以憎恶世人——这些受苦受难的灵魂？不，我会为每一个受到伤害的人祈祷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我说的是“文明”。人们将在这场战争中尝尽“文明”的苦果，而“文明”亦将倾覆其自身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>工厂会被拆毁，以“进步”为名的奇谈怪论会被抛弃，人们会离开如同索多玛一般罪恶的都市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——我们要回到一个纯洁而朴实的昨日世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>别再搬出你那一套说教，拉蒂斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>逐渐沉溺的宣教者被一声呵斥惊醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜拦在玛尔纱与拉蒂斯之间。她先与堂兄对视一眼，后者不自觉地向后退了小半步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你让玛德琳姨妈没能端上给客人的茶水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜转过身，将一只沉重的军用帆布包递给玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-526511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>好沉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>拿得动吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>完全没问题，我的体力还相当够用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯见证这一幕，疑云满面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>这又是在干什么，玛丽安娜。你刚在蒙佩杀死了基金会的合作人，现在转过头又和基金会站到一起了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这是个人交往。从今天起，教堂不再对她隐匿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>可她并不是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这里我说了算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>……是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯顺从地低下头，完全失去了一分钟前高高在上的气度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>处理完家务事的玛丽安娜再次转向玛尔纱。此时，误入家族纠纷的玛尔纱揣着包裹，已被吓退到五步之外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>从1918年开始，我找到过的重要线索都在这，其中包括了与重塑之手有明确合作的军队高层名单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>如果基金会真的像你说的那样能让这些东西发挥价值，那你就先带它们离开吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我、我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士以惊人的速度撤离了战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛德琳姨妈立在一根石柱下，手中端着茶水，自责地颔首垂目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露天教堂的庭院中安静了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯沉寂良久，终于板起他那张枯瘦的脸，再度开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>堂亲……为什么你总是如此执着地走入纷争？我们本可以避开这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>即使这场战争真的是一场天罚，那世人受的苦难也已经够多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>——可人们并不知悔改！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯弓着背，靠近教堂角落中掩面哭泣的少女。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>难道艾格尼丝的现状还不能令你有所觉悟吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>别把她牵扯进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>可正是艾格尼丝带来了有关战争的预兆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人遁入一场回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>在战争爆发之后，艾格尼丝陷入了长久石化的沉眠中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>她是我们之中最接近圣洁的人，命运本不应该如此，这一定是她通过自我牺牲的方式为我们带来征兆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>如果艾格尼丝“雕塑化”真的是一种预兆，为什么老天不把话说得更明白些？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>因为这是神圣的隐秘——如同古老时代的书卷，总是把真理与奥秘隐藏在最晦涩的文字中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯的声音颤抖起来，喉头演奏出集谦卑与骄傲于一体的宣道式嗓音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>而我，解读了这份隐秘——它警醒我们避开战争，保持隐匿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我向你预言，战争绝不可能在灭尽一切罪恶之前结束，艾格尼丝只会在一个纯洁的世界与我们相见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>到那时，必然要有虔敬之人来重建新世界的信仰。而我们的族裔担负着的就是这样的使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>不要再涉身于杀戮之中，不要再呼唤血液中的恶魔，玷污本就有罪的灵魂。你理应听从我的教诲，堂亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他以尊长般的威严结束了最后一句话，嘴角保持着长时间的颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>已经听惯了的玛丽安娜未能受到鼓舞，反倒是哀伤漫上了她的双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>机枪，火炮，坦克，飞机……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>如果你记得这些机器如何将我们毁灭，又如何变得越来越强大，你就应该明白——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>昨日的世界已经被彻底毁灭，我们永远也回不到过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>如果背负罪孽就能结束这场战争……这个代价对我来说，实在是微不足道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯惊骇不已，眼中闪着泪花。他背过身，面向祭坛，瘦长的身躯隐藏在高大花窗投下的阴影中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>你的发言令我惊恐，堂亲，我必须提醒你，我们的祖先中出现过真正堕落的恶魔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>而我……不希望“玛丽安娜”也成为必须被从谱系中抹去的一个名字。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-12"}}